// A page section of hand-picked destinations shown as a mosaic of cards. Its heading is the
// optional jcr:title (an h2). destinations is the editor's selection, in the order picked: the
// first four are shown, any further pick is ignored. A destination that no longer resolves
// (deleted, not yet published) is skipped. The namespaces are declared in settings/definitions.cnd.
[ctrv:mosaic] > jnt:content, mix:title, ctrvmix:pageComponent, ctplmix:sectionStyle
 - destinations (weakreference, picker[type='editorial']) mandatory multiple < ctrv:destination
